description:
Close mitre/hdf-libs#45.

Different bug class than #43/#44. hdf-mappings main entry currently fails at runtime: import('@mitre/hdf-mappings') → ERR_IMPORT_ATTRIBUTE_MISSING. Root cause: JSON imports without 'with { type: "json" }' attribute (Node 22+ requires it for ESM JSON imports).

Find every .json import in hdf-mappings/src/**/*.ts and add the import attribute:
  // before: import data from './data/cci.json';
  // after:  import data from './data/cci.json' with { type: 'json' };

Verify TS config + tsdown preserve the attribute through compilation. TS 5.3+ + tsdown should handle correctly when targeting Node 22+.

See design plan Step 6.

Acceptance criteria:
- [ ] All JSON imports updated with attribute
- [ ] import('@mitre/hdf-mappings') succeeds at runtime in dist build
- [ ] Issue #45 closed by PR
